THIRD-PARTY CODE
================

None. All code in this mod is original.

PudimMod deliberately does not reimplement what AutoCiv already provides —
the two mods are designed to run side by side, each covering different
ground. AutoCiv was read as a reference for engine integration techniques,
but no code was copied from it.

If that ever changes, this file must be updated: AutoCiv is GPL-3.0,
